{"summary": "The file proves, for every 0<δ<1/2, the following, where R₂(δ) is limsup (1/n) log₂ A(n, ⌈δn⌉):
- R₂(δ) ≤ κ_bin(δ) = min{κ_H(δ), κ_CW(δ)}.
